cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KERNELDARWIN, cite this software and the relevant research foundations in docs/prior-art.md."
title: "KERNELDARWIN Workload: Verified GPU workload investigation and guarded computation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Abdul-Hadi"
    given-names: "Nazeeh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nazeeh111/KERNELDARWIN"
url: "https://github.com/nazeeh111/KERNELDARWIN"
version: "0.3.0"
abstract: >-
  Local cosine-search computation, bounded authored Metal kernels and
  source/device-bound static dispatch with compiled MLX fallback. Executed
  numerical evidence is separate from performance confirmation. The first
  frozen workload study failed application promotion; no acceleration is
  claimed. Earlier CPU investigation controls remain preserved.
keywords:
  - gpu-optimization
  - Metal
  - MLX
  - performance engineering
  - auto-tuning
  - reproducible benchmarking
